      {
        "identifier": "leanprover-community/physlib",
        "note": "Seventeen modules (Hermitian matrices with the Loewner order, trace inner product, continuous functional calculus, Jordan product) by Alex Meiburg, with HermitianMat/Proj.lean also by Leonardo A Lessa, vendored at commit a50684a191 under EuclideanJordan/Vendor/ with per-file copyright headers retained. They form the concrete carrier H_n(K) on which the abstract class is shown to be inhabited. The modules match that upstream pin except for two documented mechanical edits, an import-path rewrite and one restored set_option; the edit log is in EuclideanJordan/Vendor/VENDOR.md. The vendored modules are inside the audited tree, so the axiom census runs over every declaration in them.",
        "relationship": "builds-on"
      },
      {
        "identifier": "leanprover-community/mathlib4",
        "note": "Mathlib supplies IsCommJordan (commutativity plus the Jordan identity) and five operator-commutation lemmas, plus the linear algebra, polynomial ideal theory and trace machinery the proofs run on. It carries no idempotent theory, no Peirce decomposition and no Jordan spectral theory; that is what this development adds. The Mathlib-facing upstream shape for Albert's theorem is the existing PNatPowAssoc class, and transporting jpow_mul_jpow across it is not done here.",
        "relationship": "builds-on"
      }
    ],
